{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>It has grown dim.</b> It grew dim from its appearance — but if it stayed the same in its appearance or spread, it is unclean." "<b>A scurf.</b> The name of a clean plague." "<b>And he shall wash his garments and be clean.</b> Since it required confinement, it is called unclean and requires immersion."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:06:05.957822604Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}